# Shader sources are hashed byte for byte against the hash checked in beside their compiled binary (UIEngine.csproj's
# CompileSpriteEffects), so line endings must never be converted on checkout.
*.fx -text
*.fxb binary
*.fxb.sha256 -text

# Content tables are edited a line at a time by the Workshop; keep them LF so every line it writes matches its neighbours.
*.jsonl text eol=lf
